<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA - MAAPANK TO APPLY FOR BOURSE LISTING IN JULY.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA - MAAPANK TO APPLY FOR BOURSE LISTING IN JULY.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Balti Cresco said on Monday that Eesti Maapank (Estonian Land Bank) will apply for a listing on the Tallinn bourse in July.</p>
<p>&quot;We will get the registration process ready after the release of the bank's six-month financial results,&quot; Indrek Rahumaa, the head of corporate finance with Balti Cresco, told Reuters.</p>
<p>Eesti Maapank is one of the smallest banks in Estonia with a strong regional focus. Its assets were at 1.2 billion kroons at the end of April.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn Newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
